{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "letter-from-mifamem",
  "name": "Letter from Mifamem",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Letter_from_Mifamem",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-28T09:31:09.357Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "about-repairing",
      "label": "About Repairing",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my dear friend Snowy:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c3ec245c5dbb22ab"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You wrote back! I was so excited that I greeted every passing fairy!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Chief told me you'd gone somewhere far, far away and couldn't possibly reply."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I never believed him. It was really you, wasn't it?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ca53212dc8f91d94"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(I followed your instructions and made a broom. The house was sparkling clean in no time."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The power of a broom is incredible."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "/I tossed out most of the furniture — except for that clay jar."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We used it back then to hold the wild berries we picked."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The berries are long gone, but it still carries that sweet, tangy scent.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-99d443c5ef74cd94"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I probably shouldn't check the mailbox daily. It's getting worn out so fast."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Back then, you fixed it in just one afternoon with all those clinking and clanking."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "How exactly did you do it? I'd like to fix it myself, but I simply can't remember how."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5234697bc9f8d0aa"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your dear friend"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mifamem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-11aa866e7e5f0b7f"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "about-cleaning",
      "label": "About Cleaning",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my dear friend :"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3e0595378d5d621a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Good morning, good afternoon, and good evening to you."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You haven't written back once since that rushed goodbye."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Do you still remember our promise to explore the outside world together?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c363e61d72cae513"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've been diligently practicing my branch swings — one hundred times every single day, mem!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You're so terribly late that I'm really starting to get upset, mem!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-040104ed38591bce"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even if you've already embarked on your journey without me, please write and share your adventures."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'll read them as bedtime stories and fall asleep with your letters beneath my pillow."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f72aeac9b451f183"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your dear friend"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mifamem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-11aa866e7e5f0b7f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "P.S. Snowy, the Chief borrowed your \"Wondrous Cleaning Gadget\" and completely wore it out. I've tried everything to fix it, but nothing works. Now the dust on my cabinet is thick as a snowdrift and flies everywhere at the slightest touch. What should I do, my dear friend?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-113d449d0f7ad3d5"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "volumeKey": "about-cooking",
      "label": "About Cooking",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my dear friend Snowy:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c3ec245c5dbb22ab"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(Heh, how I wish you could see the mailbox now!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "While I was at it, I fixed the crooked shelves and creaky beams too."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even if I'm gone one day, they'll stay solid and steady — right up until the world's very end!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "/Sorry, partner, I didn't really get everything you said."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But after asking the chief, I gave the repairs a try. It wasn't too bad, I guess?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The mailman seemed oddly inspired by it though!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It mumbled something about \"instant messaging,\" \"mobile payments,\" and \"the internet connects everything,\" before leaving."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So strange, mem.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b26a3d8f5ea4f580"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "There's something I've been curious about for a while."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "How is it that I receive replies so promptly whenever I send you a letter?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Would you mind sharing that little secret with me?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b4299765e4af4ef1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "All this activity has made my tummy rumble like crazy..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I can still remember exactly how that cookie tasted when you broke it in half and shared it with me."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If you wouldn't mind, could you teach me your recipe?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d7419aa08bd027c8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your dear friend"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mifamem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-11aa866e7e5f0b7f"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "volumeKey": "about-adventure",
      "label": "About Adventure",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my dear friend Snowy:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c3ec245c5dbb22ab"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Good morning, good afternoon, and good evening!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A kindhearted traveler helped repair my wind chime."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And guess what? I've finally embarked on an adventure, just like you did!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-404ab3d247d4a1e9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've crossed the farthest hill and climbed the highest branch."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Then floated down holding onto dandelion fluff."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've sipped the sweet waters of forest streams and wrapped myself in thick leaves for warmth."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "During downpours, I found shelter within cozy tree hollows."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3a34a0742b0c2e05"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And yesterday, I found myself in a standoff with a beetle."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I brandished my branch and claimed victory, winning some delicious nuts as my reward!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f7bd27087ae00817"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've asked the beetle to bring you this letter with my question—"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "How exactly does one start a fire, mem?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've grown quite weary of crunchy biscuits and desperately crave something warm and cozy!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d6d2bce8e80cf8ef"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your dear friend"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mifamem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-11aa866e7e5f0b7f"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
